{"276460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Curse of Dragon Mountains 2: The Lair", "steam_appid": 276460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/276460/extras/aebff1833f0434079fe6c06f00260f0a.avif?t=1764587179\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever felt dark shadows creeping back into your dreams? The peace in Dragon Mountains was restored when Lord Strix was defeated — but now, evil stirs again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to Dragon Mountains with Mina and her spirited companion Malik and defeat the evil spirit in this compelling hidden-object adventure where fantasy, folklore, and mystery intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/276460/extras/858b970dd02c87edce4e38e674ae43ca.avif?t=1764587179\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔎 Hidden Object &amp; Puzzle Adventure – investigate  scenes and solve mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Dozens of locations &amp; mini-games – mystery lurks from every dark corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ Hint &amp; Journal – always know where to go next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 Full voiceovers &amp; HD visuals – immerse yourself in the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ Difficulty levels – from relaxed exploration to true challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📴 Play completely offline — anytime, anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔒 No data collection — your privacy is safe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹 Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click / Tap to search scenes, collect clues, combine items from your inventory, and complete mini-games to progress the story. Use hints if you get stuck — but the reward is uncovering more of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Play your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, investigate and solve the mystery in your own way: adjustable challenge: Casual, Adventure, and Challenging difficulty modes. Win Achievements &amp; Collectibles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌 Atmospheric adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gripping mystery: narrative-driven gameplay with a strong detective lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive locations: explore, seeks, search and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/276460/extras/8676a2851b8fcdfe2e13a48c10c1f661.avif?t=1764587179\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > FIND and STOP the evil Lord Strix</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > INVESTIGATE dozens of fantasy locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > SEARCH for clues and FIND HIDDEN OBJECTS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > SOLVE hundreds of quests and puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > HELP people and creatures of Dragon Mountains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > EARN achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3 DIFFICULTY MODES: customize how much help the game will provide you in your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > BEAUTIFUL high-definition graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > DISCOVER a TALE of friendship and courage</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai